            </valueSettings>
            <valueSettings>
                <controllingFieldValue>DCG Comms Infrastructure Deal #</controllingFieldValue>
                <valueName>New Infrastructure Deal Wins for uCPE/NFVi/Datacenter based on: NPG SOC products &amp; Cascade Lake-SP products for CoSP; Co-Sale  Skylake, Cascade, SOC, and RAN Infrastructure CoSP Targets unique, Partner (OxM/TEM/ISV/SI) may be shared</valueName>
            </valueSettings>
            <valueSettings>
                <controllingFieldValue>DCG Enterprise &amp; Gov&apos;t Deal #</controllingFieldValue>
                <valueName>E&amp;G Account Xeon® End User HPC, DC Cloud Modernization (SDS, HCI, SDN, NFV), &amp; Analytics (Scale Up/Out, Ent AI) On/Off Prem Deal Wins. Deal # as proxy for CPU units. Off-Prem guidance: 12mo spend @ CSP = $225K(EM), $450K(MM). Parent of E&amp;G Deal # KPIs.</valueName>
            </valueSettings>
            <valueSettings>
                <controllingFieldValue>DCG Partner Enablement Deal #</controllingFieldValue>
